### TalentBridge Post API — auth cycle
### Run top to bottom (VS Code REST Client / Rider / VS). Needs the API on :5001
### and a Postgres per README. Cookies are handled by the client automatically.

@host = http://localhost:5001
@email = dana.whitfield@northline.co
@password = CorrectHorse42

### Liveness / readiness
GET {{host}}/health

###
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### 1. Sign up → 201, Set-Cookie tb_refresh, body has accessToken + manager
# @name signup
POST {{host}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "fullName": "Dana Whitfield",
  "organization": "Northline"
}

### 1b. Invalid sign-up → 400 ValidationProblemDetails, keys match form controls
POST {{host}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dana@gmail.com",
  "password": "short",
  "fullName": "D",
  "organization": "N"
}

### 2. Log in → 200 (email is case-insensitive)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2b. Wrong password → 401 with a generic message
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "not-the-password"
}

### 3. Who am I → 200
GET {{host}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Refresh (cookie) → 200, rotated pair; old token is now revoked
# @name refresh
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh

### 4b. Refresh (body form, for non-browser clients) — replaying the OLD token → 401 and revokes the family
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### 5. Log out → 204, cookie cleared
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout

### 6. Rate limit: send this 6+ times within 5 minutes → 429 + Retry-After
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "someone@northline.co",
  "password": "wrong"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Job postings (all require the bearer from step 2)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 7. Create → 201 with the complete persisted record + Location
# @name create
POST {{host}}/api/job-postings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "referenceCode": "REF-4471",
  "title": "Senior Warehouse Supervisor",
  "department": "Operations",
  "employmentType": "FullTime",
  "seniority": "Senior",
  "openings": 2,
  "workArrangement": "Hybrid",
  "location": "Leeds, West Yorkshire",
  "country": "United Kingdom",
  "salaryMin": 38000,
  "salaryMax": 46000,
  "salaryCurrency": "GBP",
  "payPeriod": "Annual",
  "salaryVisible": true,
  "description": "Northline's Leeds distribution hub handles 40,000 outbound units a week. You'll own the evening shift.",
  "responsibilities": "Run the evening shift\nCoach team leads",
  "skills": ["Warehouse ops", "WMS", "Team leadership"],
  "applicationEmail": "careers@northline.co",
  "closingDate": "2026-10-23",
  "status": "Published"
}

### 7b. Invalid → 400, keys match the Angular form controls; salary range is keyed to salaryMax
POST {{host}}/api/job-postings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ab",
  "department": "Operations",
  "employmentType": "Gig",
  "seniority": "Senior",
  "workArrangement": "Hybrid",
  "location": "Leeds",
  "country": "United Kingdom",
  "salaryMin": 46000,
  "salaryMax": 38000,
  "salaryCurrency": "GBP",
  "description": "Too short.",
  "applicationUrl": "northline.co/careers",
  "closingDate": "2020-01-01"
}

### 8. List my postings (q, status=All|Draft|Published|Closed|Expired, sort=createdDesc|createdAsc|closingAsc|closingDesc|titleAsc|titleDesc, page, pageSize≤50)
GET {{host}}/api/job-postings?status=Published&sort=createdDesc&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 9. Get one
GET {{host}}/api/job-postings/{{create.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 10. Update — send the version you loaded; a stale version → 409
PUT {{host}}/api/job-postings/{{create.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": {{create.response.body.version}},
  "referenceCode": "REF-4471",
  "title": "Warehouse Shift Lead",
  "department": "Operations",
  "employmentType": "FullTime",
  "seniority": "Lead",
  "openings": 3,
  "workArrangement": "Hybrid",
  "location": "Leeds, West Yorkshire",
  "country": "United Kingdom",
  "salaryMin": 40000,
  "salaryMax": 48000,
  "salaryCurrency": "GBP",
  "payPeriod": "Annual",
  "salaryVisible": true,
  "description": "Northline's Leeds distribution hub handles 40,000 outbound units a week. You'll own the evening shift.",
  "skills": ["WMS"],
  "applicationEmail": "careers@northline.co",
  "closingDate": "2026-10-30",
  "status": "Published"
}

### 11. Close — irreversible; a later PUT → 409
POST {{host}}/api/job-postings/{{create.response.body.id}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
